{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"1fc73529eeeb3295","type":"group","x":-700,"y":-300,"width":900,"height":280,"label":"Encounter Group 2"},
		{"id":"3e94b25da98d9012","type":"group","x":-1880,"y":-300,"width":880,"height":280,"label":"Encounter Group 1"},
		{"id":"ef5086228619ff4c","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart - Morlaith's Domain.md","x":-890,"y":-1720,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"29c5a58367fc22dc","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - Caradoc.md","x":-605,"y":-2200,"width":400,"height":280},
		{"id":"b01d9242e9aec05e","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart - Singing Tree Restored.md","x":-200,"y":-1720,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"feyexplore0000001","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - Fork in the Path.md","x":-1860,"y":-280,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"feyexplore0000002","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - The Following Foxes.md","x":-1420,"y":-280,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"bda6df8d731b7744","type":"text","text":"# Group 1\n\nProbably won't notice the path is repeating at first. But as you walk, might hear sounds of something moving in the forest, along the path (DC 18 Perception check to hear; DC 22 to catch a glimpse). \n\nThis is two fox-people that are curious why such strange people are in the forest. If the party moves off the path to investigate, run the Following Foxes. \n\nAt some point, will come to a fork. Run The Fork in the Path. \n\nIf ignore both, and stay on the path, will eventually come to the same fork, again. And again, while at some point the foxes may come onto the road. \n\nDon't let this loop forever. The foxes can be a firebreak if needed. \n\n","x":-1500,"y":-794,"width":660,"height":355},
		{"id":"d87d2118b7977a78","type":"text","text":"\n**Hunter pressure and transitions:** Repeatedly circling the starting path without progress allows hunters to close in. Moving from Group 1 to Group 2 after an unsuccessful encounter does not automatically require a hunter fight. Apply the progress-based guidance in [[Exploration Failure - Umbraeth's Hunters]].","x":-2020,"y":-1004,"width":266,"height":289},
		{"id":"58a403f8393d5254","type":"text","text":"**Looping path and foxlings:** On reaching the fork a second time, the party automatically recognizes it. If they continue circling without investigating, the foxlings openly approach them. Continued lack of progress after that uses the hunter-pressure guidance in [[Exploration Failure - Umbraeth's Hunters]].\n","x":-2412,"y":-280,"width":392,"height":169},
		{"id":"feyfailure000001","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Exploration Failure - Umbraeth's Hunters.md","x":-880,"y":1160,"width":550,"height":240,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"ba838b575c5c2d2e","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - Getting Gwydren to Help.md","x":1754,"y":-300,"width":400,"height":420},
		{"id":"02ffb3a4f1b0470f","type":"text","text":"# The Path\n\nDefault route. A wooded path, dense and thick. Mirkwood vibes and old dense English forest. Thick undergrowth, dim light, still and quiet. Moss draped everywhere, can't see far. Occasional old spider webs from a too-big spider, rotting fallen logs with scurrying things underneath. Other bits of creepiness.\n\nThe path repeats itself. You cannot actually make progress walking through the woods, to any particular destination. Unless you have a guide. \n\nStage encounters in blocks. Every time you venture off the path, you potentially find yourself somewhere new. \n","x":-985,"y":-1200,"width":515,"height":340},
		{"id":"feyexplore0000003","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - Woodland Revel.md","x":-680,"y":-280,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"feysuccess000001","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Exploration Success - Guide Clue.md","x":280,"y":660,"width":550,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"feyguide00000001","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Finding the Guide.md","x":710,"y":1140,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"2136157f0c07c6ee","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - The River Crossing.md","x":200,"y":-908,"width":400,"height":416},
		{"id":"feyexplore0000004","type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - Canopy.md","x":-250,"y":-280,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"becf3cee20c2880a","type":"text","text":"# Group 2\n\nTransition to group 2 encounters happens either because success on one or both of Group 1 encounters leads to finding the new path, or because failure leads to getting lost in the forest, fighting Umbraeth hunters, then stumbling on a new path. \n\nThis path does not loop. It leads roughly east, running fairly smooth and narrow, but sloping down. \n\nAs they follow this path, two optional scenes present themselves. \n\nThe path ends at a river, forcing the river scene. ","x":-451,"y":-800,"width":491,"height":308},
		{"id":"7cdf728221f3a261","type":"text","text":"# Finding the Guide\n\nGywdren hangs out at one of the big trees across the river. If the party succeeds on the woodland revel quest, they'll know his favorite tree. If they fail, they won't. \n\nIf they know his favorite tree, treat reaching him as a short narration after the river. \n\nIf they don't know his favorite tree, treat this as a Survival check that determines if they get lost. Pseudodragon scouting can help considerably. Failure here potentially leads to Gloomshaper hunter encounter, depending, but probably doesn't need to unless things go particularly badly. \n\nThen, of course, they need to convince Gywdren to help them. \n","x":830,"y":-394,"width":570,"height":354},
		{"id":"4e03429dcb58180b","x":1840,"y":400,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - Race to Tree 1.md"},
		{"id":"6419ea411511af47","x":1720,"y":1960,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - The Singing Tree Encounter.md"},
		{"id":"099362eff4edc3b0","x":1920,"y":1160,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - Race to Tree 2.md"},
		{"id":"1c8a5e4cc3328d67","x":2640,"y":480,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - Race to Tree 3.md"},
		{"id":"ec1396c40eaa6d9e","x":2640,"y":1440,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"file","file":"_dm_notes/_Addermarch/Adventure 7 - The Fey Heart/Scene Templates/Fey Heart Scene - Race to Tree 4.md"}
	],
